'''Best of the Best''' (超選抜祭ガチャ, ''Chō Senbatsusai Gacha'', '''Super Selection Festival Gacha''') is a [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] event added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]]. It features [[Trixi the Merc (Uber Rare Cat)|Trixi the Merc]] along with selected Uber Rare units from the regular Rare Cat Capsule events.

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 70%
}}

